{%- comment -%}
  ═══ LBASS — HOMEPAGE OFFER STATEMENT + COLLECTION LINKS (2026-08-26) ═══

  WHY IT EXISTS
  AI assistants send real traffic to the homepage and it converts badly. The
  homepage's main "shop by category" grid is `<div id="catsGrid"></div>` —
  EMPTY in the HTML, filled by JavaScript at runtime. Most LLM crawlers do not
  execute JS, so the store's primary internal links to its own categories were
  invisible to exactly the referrers we are trying to convert. This block is
  plain server-rendered Liquid: it is in the HTML for every crawler and every
  visitor, with no JS at all.

  There was already an AI block on this page (`#lb-ai-block`) but it is
  `display:none` and only un-hides when `document.referrer` matches a known AI
  host. Referrers are frequently stripped — in-app browsers, privacy modes,
  and most crawlers send none — so it cannot be the only route. This block is
  unconditional and serves every visitor.

  EVERY LINK IS PROVEN NON-EMPTY BEFORE IT RENDERS
  Each entry is skipped unless the collection actually holds products. That is
  not defensive padding — measured 2026-08-26, the homepage was linking to
  /collections/هوديات-و-سويت, which holds 0 products and returns a hard 404.
  A count check means a link can never rot into a 404 when stock sells out.

  WHAT IS DELIBERATELY NOT LINKED HERE
  - Football shirts: the shop has none. It has two pairs of football BOOTS.
    Linking a category with no stock sends people to an empty page.
  - "Vintage" and "New arrivals" as tag URLs: `/collections/all/<tag>` is INERT
    on this store — measured, it returns all 64 products whatever the tag. So
    is `?sort_by=`. Those URLs look filtered and are not. The audited drop is
    linked instead as the real new-arrivals equivalent.
  - brand-adidas / brand-nike: both 301 to adidas-originals / nike. Link the
    destination, not the redirect.

  PAGE POLARITY — MEASURED, DO NOT GUESS
  This page's tokens are INVERTED at runtime. The source says --ink:#0A0A0B and
  --cream:#F4EFE6, which reads as a dark page and is WRONG. Measured in-browser
  2026-08-26 on the live homepage:
      --ink   -> #FFFFFF        body background -> rgb(255,255,255)
      --cream -> #0B0B0C        body colour     -> rgb(11,11,12)
      --gold  -> #BF2E15        (a dark red, not gold)
  So this block owns its colours literally instead of inheriting tokens that
  mean the opposite of their names. All values below are dark-on-light and
  measured against #FAF7F2 / #FFF. Never restyle this file from token names.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign hc_rows = 'صبابط@@صبابط · Sneakers||adidas-originals@@Adidas||nike@@Nike||جاكيطات-و-معاطف@@جاكيطات · Jackets||تيشرتات-و-بولو@@تيشرتات · T-shirts||سراويل-و-كارغو@@سراويل · Pants||track-pants@@Track Pants||إكسسوارات@@إكسسوارات · Accessories||one-of-one@@قطع 1/1||audited-drop-p001-p012@@الدروب الكامل'
  assign hc_pairs = hc_rows | split: '||'
-%}

{%- capture hc_links -%}
  {%- for pair in hc_pairs -%}
    {%- assign bits = pair | split: '@@' -%}
    {%- assign h = bits[0] -%}
    {%- assign label = bits[1] -%}
    {%- assign col = collections[h] -%}
    {%- assign available_products = col.products | where: 'available', true -%}
    {%- assign n = available_products.size -%}
    {%- comment -%} never render a link to an empty collection — see 404 note above {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if n > 0 -%}
      <a class="lbhc__chip" href="{{ col.url }}"
         data-cro-event="home_collection_click"
         data-cro-label="{{ h }}">{{ label }}<span class="lbhc__n">{{ n }}</span></a>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- assign hc_count = hc_links | split: 'lbhc__chip' | size | minus: 1 -%}

{%- if hc_count > 2 -%}
<section class="lbhc" aria-labelledby="lbhc-h">
  <style>
    /* dark-on-light — see PAGE POLARITY note above. Tokens on this page are inverted. */
    .lbhc{padding:clamp(26px,4vw,44px) var(--pad,20px)}
    .lbhc__in{max-width:var(--max,1100px);margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(20px,3vw,30px);
      border:1px solid rgba(11,11,12,.14);border-radius:16px;background:#FAF7F2}
    .lbhc__kick{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;
      color:#BF2E15;direction:ltr}
    .lbhc h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:clamp(19px,2.4vw,26px);line-height:1.35;color:#0B0B0C}
    .lbhc__lede{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#2E2E31;max-width:70ch}
    .lbhc__lede-en{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#3A3A3C;
      max-width:70ch;direction:ltr}
    .lbhc__row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:0 0 18px}
    .lbhc__chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:40px;
      padding:9px 15px;border:1px solid rgba(11,11,12,.20);border-radius:999px;
      background:#fff;color:#0B0B0C;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;
      transition:background-color .18s,color .18s,border-color .18s,transform .18s}
    .lbhc__chip:hover,.lbhc__chip:focus-visible{background:#0B0B0C;color:#F4EFE6;
      border-color:#0B0B0C;transform:translateY(-1px)}
    .lbhc__chip:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #BF2E15;outline-offset:2px}
    .lbhc__n{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:900;opacity:.62;direction:ltr}
    .lbhc__facts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 18px;margin:0;padding:14px 0 0;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(11,11,12,.12);list-style:none}
    .lbhc__facts li{font-size:13px;color:#2E2E31}
    .lbhc__facts b{color:#0B0B0C}
    .lbhc__facts a{color:#BF2E15;font-weight:800}
    @media(max-width:600px){
      .lbhc__chip{font-size:13px;padding:9px 13px}
      .lbhc__facts{gap:6px 14px}
    }
  </style>
  <div class="lbhc__in">
    <p class="lbhc__kick">WHAT WE SELL</p>
    <h2 id="lbhc-h">حوايج براند second-hand و vintage أصلية، مختارة وحدة بوحدة</h2>
    <p class="lbhc__lede">Lbass Original كيبيع حوايج براند مستعملة أصلية فالمغرب — صبابط، جاكيطات، تراك، تيشرتات وإكسسوارات. كل قطعة مصورة بصورها هي، الحالة والقياس مكتوبين قبل ما تطلب.</p>
    <p class="lbhc__lede-en">Curated second-hand and vintage branded clothing in Morocco — Nike, Adidas, jackets, sneakers, track pants and accessories. Every piece is photographed exactly as it is, with its condition and measured size stated before you order.</p>

    <div class="lbhc__row">{{ hc_links }}</div>

    <ul class="lbhc__facts">
      <li>🚚 التوصيل: <b>20 درهم مراكش</b> · <b>40 درهم باقي المغرب</b> · مجاني من 500</li>
      <li>💳 <b>COD</b> — خلّص ملي توصلك · أو <b>PayPal</b></li>
      <li>↩ <a href="/pages/refund-policy">الإرجاع 14 يوم مع PayPal</a></li>
      <li>💬 <a href="https://wa.me/491754264425" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cro-event="whatsapp_click" data-cro-label="home_collections_block">سولنا فالواتساب</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}
